    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="F_ena_abs" name="fraction absorbed enalapril" value="0.577261573734921" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Fraction absorbed, i.e., only a fraction of the enalapril in the
intestinal lumen is absorbed, <code>(1 - F_ena_abs)</code> is excreted in the
feces. 56 +- 6 % of an oral dose of 14C-enalapril are recovered in the
urine and 39 +- 5 % in the feces {Ulm1982, Ball1987}; the absorption is
60-64 % {Hockings1986, Dickstein1987}.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <distrib:listOfUncertainties>
          <distrib:uncertainty distrib:name="fit PK_20261020_114902__1f0f7">
            <notes>
